@api = http://localhost:5080
@schemaRegistry = http://localhost:18081

### Create a product (happy path) -> 201 Created
POST {{api}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Notebook"
}

### Blank name -> 400 ValidationProblem (exercises the error wire types with reflection off)
POST {{api}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   "
}

### The subject registered by the first publish
GET {{schemaRegistry}}/subjects/product-created-value/versions/latest

### All registered subjects
GET {{schemaRegistry}}/subjects
